flowchart TD
    subgraph CoroutineFrame["📦 Coroutine Frame (堆積記憶體佈局)"]
        direction TB
        Header["🏷️ <b>Function Pointers &amp; State</b><br/>Resume Fn · Destroy Fn · Suspend Index"]
        PromiseObj["🎯 <b>promise_type (TaskPromise&lt;T&gt;)</b><br/>continuation_ · exception_ · result_"]
        ArgsLocals["💾 <b>Parameters &amp; Local Variables</b><br/>req, buffer, total_read, sock..."]
    end

    Handle["🔗 <b>std::coroutine_handle&lt;promise_type&gt;</b><br/>(非擁有指標，指向 Frame 起始位址)"]
    TaskObj["🛡️ <b>Task&lt;T&gt; (RAII 封裝)</b><br/>持有 handle_ · 解構時 handle_.destroy()"]

    Handle -->|指向| Header
    TaskObj -->|包裝| Handle

